       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks like an error.\n\nMetformin 2550 mg three times daily comes to **7,650 mg/day**. That is three times the maximum recommended daily dose of 2,550 mg/day (the usual immediate-release ceiling). A dose that high risks severe lactic acidosis and GI toxicity.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals**, which is 2,550 mg/day total.\n- **500 mg PO twice daily with meals**, a typical starting dose. It is usually titrated up slowly.\n- **1,000 mg PO twice daily with meals**, which is 2,000 mg/day.\n\nPlease confirm the dose and frequency you want, ideally after checking with your supervising resident or attending. Once you confirm, I'll enter the order right away."
